    "text": "5 hours ago JACKSONVILLE, Fla. — Wednesday night, city and school leaders came together to try to find solutions on how to make the roads safer for kids. District 3 school board member Cindy Pearson and District 5 City Councilman Joe Carlucci hosted a student safety town hall to hear concerns from parents and students. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
